{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_357df3b7ab4931c8a2305858f58799e08c2338ae484e71c57b43bf92be6d27db"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: platform-dependent behavior must stay behind runtime checks, and Windows child processes must go through the shared runProcess/spawnProcess helpers instead of child_process directly."},{"claim_ids":["clm_57b460e4b5b660c40632f715be93c0532145751a6642d555a7b00da8370c08a6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: Git 2.25 is treated as the core-workflow compatibility baseline, with capability caching scoped per executing host (native, WSL, SSH, or relay)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ac0c2ba60dfafe95f8372893349d29d0a6e090be07db5d2227fa0f09048577e4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: Electron UI validation must run in the background with `ORCA_BACKGROUND_LAUNCH=1`, never stealing focus, using Playwright CDP screenshots of hidden renderers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ca9c5340e6ecf263a0e20d5af8ce199e01b53448d272ddc5c24161d3a657ff12"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: UI work must follow docs/STYLEGUIDE.md and use design tokens from main.css and shadcn primitives rather than inventing new values."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dd495ee73575222164a5465aa69fb5d62f5cbc00444ef1bb2ec538a6b1c62b82"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors verify changes with `pnpm tc` for typecheck, `pnpm test` for tests, and `oxlint`/`pnpm format` for linting and formatting."}],"claim_ids":["clm_357df3b7ab4931c8a2305858f58799e08c2338ae484e71c57b43bf92be6d27db","clm_57b460e4b5b660c40632f715be93c0532145751a6642d555a7b00da8370c08a6","clm_ac0c2ba60dfafe95f8372893349d29d0a6e090be07db5d2227fa0f09048577e4","clm_ca9c5340e6ecf263a0e20d5af8ce199e01b53448d272ddc5c24161d3a657ff12","clm_dd495ee73575222164a5465aa69fb5d62f5cbc00444ef1bb2ec538a6b1c62b82"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_20